* ============================================================
* Nested DC sweep on a CMOS inverter built with level-2 BSIM4.
*   outer loop : VDD  1.0 -> 3.0 V step 0.5   (5 points)
*   inner loop : VG   0.0 -> 2.0 V step 0.5   (5 points)
* -> 25 operating points, two swept columns in the CSV.
* Exercises: nested .DC + level-2 devices + streamed CSV.
* ============================================================

.MODEL NMOS2 NMOS2 (LEVEL=2 VTH0=0.45 KP=120e-6 GAMMA=0.4 PHI=0.7 LAMBDA=0.02 U0=0.45 TOX=8e-9 NFS=1e11 VSAT=8e4)

.MODEL PMOS2 PMOS2 (LEVEL=2 VTH0=-0.45 KP=40e-6 GAMMA=0.5 PHI=0.7 LAMBDA=0.03 U0=0.15 TOX=8e-9 NFS=1e11 VSAT=8e4)

VDD  vdd 0 DC 1.0
VG   vg  0 DC 0.0

MN   vout vg 0 0 NMOS2 W=2u L=0.5u
MP   vout vg vdd vdd PMOS2 W=4u L=0.5u
RL   vout 0 1meg          * DC load: keeps vout well posed between the rails

.DC VDD 1.0 3.0 0.5 VG 0.0 2.0 0.5

.END